  missionName: Scavenger Hunt
  missionDescription: Hunt enemies equipped with signal disruptors. These devices
    are interfering with the plane's radar system, preventing a safe takeoff. Eliminate
    the threat and clear the path for your escape.
  missionDescription_VN: "H\xE3y truy l\xF9ng nh\u1EEFng k\u1EBB \u0111\u1ECBch \u0111\u01B0\u1EE3c
    trang b\u1ECB thi\u1EBFt b\u1ECB g\xE2y nhi\u1EC5u t\xEDn hi\u1EC7u. Nh\u1EEFng
    thi\u1EBFt b\u1ECB n\xE0y \u0111ang g\xE2y nhi\u1EC5u h\u1EC7 th\u1ED1ng radar
    c\u1EE7a m\xE1y bay, ng\u0103n c\u1EA3n vi\u1EC7c c\u1EA5t c\xE1nh an to\xE0n.
    H\xE3y lo\u1EA1i b\u1ECF m\u1ED1i \u0111e d\u1ECDa v\xE0 d\u1ECDn \u0111\u01B0\u1EDDng
    cho cu\u1ED9c tho\xE1t hi\u1EC3m c\u1EE7a b\u1EA1n."
